###  http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/hasForCapaciteLearnableByLevel
<http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/hasForCapaciteLearnableByLevel> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                        rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/hasForCapaciteLearnable> ;
